---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Pat on Sports is a weekly Patriots column: honest recaps, previews, and takes."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <p class="text-[11px] font-display font-bold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-red mb-3">
      About
    </p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-wide text-navy">
      Weekly Patriots recaps, without the noise.
    </h1>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-lg text-navy-muted font-serif">
      <p>
        Pat on Sports is a one-person column on the New England Patriots. Each week
        I write a Pros &amp; Cons recap of the previous game — what worked, what
        didn’t, and what it means for the rest of the season.
      </p>
      <p>
        When the slate is bigger than one game, I’ll also write a preview. The
        archive is the whole 2025 run, from the opener in Las Vegas through the
        playoffs.
      </p>
      <p>
        Independent commentary. Not affiliated with the NFL or the New England
        Patriots.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-10">
      <a href="/blog" class="font-display font-bold tracking-wide uppercase text-navy hover:text-red">
        Browse the archive →
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
